melody:
# Refrain
In the good old sum-mer time, in the good old sum-mer time,
F4/ G4/ F4 D4(2) F4(2) Bb4 D5(3) ~D5 C5 Bb4 Bb4 C5(2) Bb4(2) G4 F4(3) r(3)
stroll-ing through the sha-dy lanes with your ba-by mine;
D4(2) F4 Bb4(2) C5 D5(2) C5 Bb4(3) C5(2) D5 C5(2) D5 C5(3) r r
You hold her hand and she holds yours, and that's a ver-y good sign
F4 D4(2) F4 Bb4(2) C5 D5(2) C5 Bb4(2) Bb4 Bb4(2) C5 Bb4 G4 Bb4 F4(3) r r
That she's your toot-sey woot-sey in the good old sum-mer time.
F4 D4(2) F4 Bb4(2) C5 D5(2) C5 Bb4(2) F4 G4 Bb4(2) Bb4(2) C5 Bb4(3) r(2)

# Once more
In the good old sum-mer time, in the good old sum-mer time,
F4/ G4/ F4 D4(2) F4(2) Bb4 D5(3) ~D5 C5 Bb4 Bb4 C5(2) Bb4(2) G4 F4(3) r(3)
stroll-ing through the sha-dy lanes with your ba-by mine;
D4(2) F4 Bb4(2) C5 D5(2) C5 Bb4(3) C5(2) D5 C5(2) D5 C5(3) r r
You hold her hand and she holds yours, and that's a ver-y good sign
F4 D4(2) F4 Bb4(2) C5 D5(2) C5 Bb4(2) Bb4 Bb4(2) C5 Bb4 G4 Bb4 F4(3) r r
That she's your toot-sey woot-sey in the good old sum-mer time.
